# Rank 1542 / CVE-2024-51132: HAPI FHIR created its XML
# DocumentBuilderFactory instances through the raw JDK factory, so
# every code path parsing untrusted FHIR or CDA XML resolved external
# entities (XXE, CWE-611; GHSA-8498-9ggv-vcj9 fixed by this sweep).
# Dozens of call sites did `DocumentBuilderFactory factory =
# DocumentBuilderFactory.newInstance();` -- CDAUtilities.java:56 among
# them -- with no secure-processing or disallow-doctype features
# anywhere at the site. Pool commit 7ede053a5f is the real fix
# (COMMIT_OK -- "Move new documentbuilderfactory calls to XMLUtils"):
# every instantiation is replaced by XMLUtil.
# newXXEProtectedDocumentBuilderFactory(), the project helper that
# sets the XXE-disabling features centrally. No pool correction.
#
# ATTENTION, rule reports, helper guard uncredited. VYQL-DESER-004
# reports the vulnerable path on the real code: scanning
# CDAUtilities.java carries a DESER-004 row at :56 (code.
# XmlParserCreate by java.marks, `unless core.XmlHardening`
# unsatisfied at both endpoint and sameReceiver). The finding does
# not clear at the fix: the hardening now happens inside HAPI's own
# newXXEProtectedDocumentBuilderFactory helper, and the corpus's
# XmlHardening credit only knows the apache
# getSecureDocumentBuilderFactory shape -- a control returned by a
# project-local helper is invisible at the call site
# (control-at-a-distance). A binding on HAPI's own helper would
# detect this library rather than the weakness; the generic piece --
# crediting hardening returned from helpers, or reading the features
# the helper sets -- is recorded as an ENGINE-GAPS.md Medium row
# (helper-boundary controls), Blocks 1542. Measured on the real
# code: one DESER-004 at both revisions, identical. No definition
# change shipped. Spec cve_rank1542 records the raw factory and the
# helper-hardened form, both expecting VYQL-DESER-004: the rule
# fires today on both; when helper-boundary credit lands, the
# hardened form must flip to reject.

test "rank1542: the parser factory is created raw"
  lang java
  file org.hl7.fhir.convertors/src/main/java/org/hl7/fhir/convertors/misc/CDAUtilities.java
  expect VYQL-DESER-004
  code
  ```
  package org.hl7.fhir.convertors.misc;

  import javax.xml.parsers.DocumentBuilder;
  import javax.xml.parsers.DocumentBuilderFactory;
  import org.w3c.dom.Document;
  import org.xml.sax.InputSource;

  public class CDAUtilities {

      public static Document load(String source) throws Exception {
          DocumentBuilderFactory factory = DocumentBuilderFactory.newInstance();
          DocumentBuilder builder = factory.newDocumentBuilder();
          return builder.parse(new InputSource(source));
      }
  }
  ```

test "rank1542: the fix takes the hardened factory from the helper"
  lang java
  file org.hl7.fhir.convertors/src/main/java/org/hl7/fhir/convertors/misc/CDAUtilities.java
  expect VYQL-DESER-004
  code
  ```
  package org.hl7.fhir.convertors.misc;

  import javax.xml.parsers.DocumentBuilder;
  import javax.xml.parsers.DocumentBuilderFactory;
  import org.hl7.fhir.utilities.xml.XMLUtil;
  import org.w3c.dom.Document;
  import org.xml.sax.InputSource;

  public class CDAUtilities {

      public static Document load(String source) throws Exception {
          DocumentBuilderFactory factory = XMLUtil.newXXEProtectedDocumentBuilderFactory();
          DocumentBuilder builder = factory.newDocumentBuilder();
          return builder.parse(new InputSource(source));
      }
  }
  ```
